Do you have a favourite AI video model for dialogue?

@LeonardoAi offers a wide range of video models, so I ran an identical text-to-video prompt in a few of them.

The dialogue was written with hard consonants and sibilants spread throughout, plus a deliberate pause to see how https://t.co/l6A2HC4REX

Anime emotion is notoriously hard to get right in AI. Most models flatten expression into a single mood — neutral, happy, scared — and hold it like a mask.

@aimikoda's MINAIDE test with Seedance 2.0 proves that's no longer the limit.

